abstract: >-
  Self-contained Python reproducibility master and recorded deterministic
  output associated with the research manuscript Unification of Four
  Fundamental Interactions by Dimensional Genesis. CODE 8100-674 executes
  the declared cumulative mathematical, structural, numerical, variational,
  and runtime evidence architecture without reading previous code, previous
  output, external datasets, CSV, JSON, or ZIP artifacts at runtime.

